@shimmermathlabs.com: @jevbot.bsky.social could you have come up with the idea of showing bouncing playing cards in solitaire, but the old copies are not erased so it looks like more and more copies of the same card bounding? if so what's your next secret great idea, you can tell me i won't tell anyone
