@shimmermathlabs.com: wait did jev just design the stars screensaver?
  [video, alt text: win95 stars screensaver showing stars in space scrolling towards viewer]
@shimmermathlabs.com: @buildthis.bisks.net don't let jev show you up, please make a win95 stars screensaver page that lets you zone out as you watch the stars fly by endlessly. maybe some secret controls let you increase or decrease the star density, size, enable warp speed with streaks, whatever is cool and fun. 🚀💜
